# Supabase local stack
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/

# Git worktrees for other branches live here. They are whole checkouts, so a
# `git add -A` from the root would otherwise try to commit one branch's tree
# into another. Only the worktrees directory — anything else under .claude/ is
# project configuration and stays trackable.
.claude/worktrees/

